# 🏥 AI Smart Health Prediction

## 📌 About the Project
AI Smart Health Prediction is a machine learning-based project designed to predict potential health risks based on user-provided health information. It analyzes input health parameters and provides intelligent predictions to support early awareness of possible health conditions.

## 🎯 Objectives
- Predict potential health risks using Machine Learning.
- Analyze user-provided health data.
- Support early identification of possible health concerns.
- Provide simple and understandable prediction results.

## ✨ Features
- User-friendly interface.
- Health data input and analysis.
- AI/ML-based health risk prediction.
- Quick prediction results.
- Easy-to-use application.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used
- Python
- Machine Learning
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Flask
- Scikit-learn

## ⚙️ Installation and Setup

1. Clone the repository:

   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/Shrowmika22/AI-smart-health-prediction.git
   ```

2. Navigate to the project folder:

   ```bash
   cd AI-smart-health-prediction
   ```

3. Install the required dependencies:

   ```bash
   pip install -r requirements.txt
   ```

4. Run the application:

   ```bash
   python app.py
   ```

5. Open the application in your browser.

## 📂 Project Structure

```text
AI-smart-health-prediction/
│
├── app.py
├── templates/
├── static/
├── requirements.txt
├── README.md
└── dataset/
```

*Note: Update the project structure and run command according to your actual files.*

## 🔮 Future Enhancements
